abstract: >-
  An invite-only heterogeneous AI network prototype with capability-aware
  routing, OpenAI-compatible ingress, encrypted persistent memory,
  cross-failure-domain replication and virtual-role migration.
  一个邀请制异构 AI 网络研究原型，提供能力感知路由、OpenAI 兼容入口、
  加密持久记忆、跨故障域复制和虚拟角色迁移。
